# robonix/service/map/get_pose_candidates — read the current run's cached
# Top-5 poses. This query never runs a search. A clear match needs no choice.
# candidates_json is a UTF-8 JSON array of up to five objects with 1-based
# rank, map-frame x/y in metres, theta in radians, and score in [0, 1].
# It is [] when needs_selection is false. Check map_id and generation against
# the current map lifecycle before using a returned pose with pose_estimate.
---
bool ok
string detail
string map_id
int64 generation
bool needs_selection
string candidates_json
